# Routing + prefix tax

When something durable emerges, route it. Do not inflate always-on memory from habit.

| Layer | Home | Use when |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **C** | Product lessons / project SoT (`REPLACE_WITH_PRODUCT_LESSONS_PATH`) | Product-only footgun |
| **A** | User harness dir (`~/.cursor`) | Short always-on pins only |
| **B** | Shared knowledge hub (`REPLACE_WITH_HUB_INBOX_OR_WIKI`) | Reusable across projects; human triages |

**Prefix tax:** A new `alwaysApply` rule rides in every request. Default is a skill or a named path. Add Layer A only when the pin must be always-on.

**Load:** named paths only. Do not dump the knowledge tree into context.

**Promote:** human triage. Do not auto-canonize.
